{"id":"en-s000001","language":"en","text":"Sarah and her daughters arrived first.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-3104572c2b77","en-pa-26d3f9e1ca07","en-pa-b786a9efe211","en-pa-205df5d95492","en-pa-2a407bf7663e"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000002","language":"en","text":"The old woman living in the basement needs help.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-d874b0bc0ce8","en-pa-9274b94bd32c","en-pa-4424bfadfdf8","en-pa-d55017cf2b67","en-pa-d776f2c08fc1","en-pa-9e8f98cd662a"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000003","language":"en","text":"It is important to know the truth.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-af1bc6c072f4","en-pa-287b1555abf0","en-pa-f9e6b1eec928","en-pa-71f74bf2d01d"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000004","language":"en","text":"To have seen him lose his temper was unexpected.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-d9b47b281acd","en-pa-3a49e68ddd7d"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000005","language":"en","text":"John was sent a copy of the letter to the president.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-04e5a783c4a1","en-pa-f3f45c6f1f4b","en-pa-a3b1e1874e19","en-pa-71dccd073bb0","en-pa-071394672c74"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000006","language":"en","text":"Writing a letter of application proved difficult.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-430855606052","en-pa-6c90e6525017","en-pa-eafa8ee8fb2d","en-pa-b9747ced96af"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000007","language":"en","text":"Did the children play?","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-10b57154a227","en-pa-7eea4980a4ab","en-pa-629388e2109d"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000008","language":"en","text":"She rang up her mother to ask her to dinner.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-90fa06d93c0e","en-pa-cd9410458d3e","en-pa-5296f4c585d9","en-pa-80815a89e7d7"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000009","language":"en","text":"She meant no harm.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-a558426a0ad8","en-pa-86903b43c1e9"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000010","language":"en","text":"He hit himself with a golf club.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-b8fa7d41a114","en-pa-0a9824d15ced","en-pa-037ed2bec61f"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000011","language":"en","text":"Whom did you see there?","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-96419cafb323","en-pa-70ae90bc7cdf"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000012","language":"en","text":"She said that she had lost her purse.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-a0063485e3d0","en-pa-8908fcb6ba45","en-pa-5c17cdb91810","en-pa-86f2024ec088"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000013","language":"en","text":"Have you decided what you will study?","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-118acda23a3b","en-pa-90cc6a77173b"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000014","language":"en","text":"Tell whoever rings me up to call back later.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-9feea309a0d8","en-pa-261178624f54"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000015","language":"en","text":"I found him a vacant flat.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-1b39b35ab6be","en-pa-ca913ec0f80a"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000016","language":"en","text":"The journey was quite pleasant.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-e29152b5fb61","en-pa-575ccd377283","en-pa-4e29534f6fb1"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000017","language":"en","text":"His hobby is collecting stamps.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-567bcf98c927","en-pa-e3a568575516","en-pa-b84e28d35f96"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000018","language":"en","text":"The town appeared abandoned.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-48f3dcb7100b","en-pa-aa05c0ddd9b1","en-pa-60d989570b9a"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000019","language":"en","text":"Worries turned his hair white.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-121ad14ce4e5","en-pa-b7669c523c82"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000020","language":"en","text":"They fought bravely.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-c7d7c669a991","en-pa-7890136f530e"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000021","language":"en","text":"He jumped for joy.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-13c731626845","en-pa-991e72e45c5d"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000022","language":"en","text":"Yesterday I helped my brother prepare lunch.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-9cf3bdd37496","en-pa-aae67144b53b"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000023","language":"en","text":"He was late because the traffic was so dense.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-3b220417875a","en-pa-0e71b499ab98"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000024","language":"en","text":"Although it was cold and rainy, we enjoyed the trip.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-572b1159fb67","en-pa-25d72b809527","en-pa-914f5f57af0c"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000025","language":"en","text":"My advice is that you should apply for the job.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-96785b006c28","en-pa-3fae3a8ce231"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000026","language":"en","text":"The question whether the atom can or cannot be split has interested scientists for decades.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-daedd3530f68","en-pa-d77ecdeba734"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000027","language":"en","text":"We could find no place where we could talk in peace.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-7ab2a2b237d4","en-pa-e80d675fd76d","en-pa-5740fd1db219"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000028","language":"en","text":"Students who work hard pass their exams.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-0d358c470e02","en-pa-ee23e2eea6ae","en-pa-696f7778dc6a"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000029","language":"en","text":"What he said cannot be denied.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-e30ddd8dfed4"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000030","language":"en","text":"Close the door.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-c0d024ceb4f3"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000031","language":"en","text":"Paul is a good student.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-9ec9031b9338","en-pa-7ab8e202b42e"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000032","language":"en","text":"He said he had lost his mind.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-2345fb9c6954"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000033","language":"en","text":"Have you finished reading the newspaper?","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-2b4ed84fc3be"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000034","language":"en","text":"He gave his wife what he had earned.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-d794d3c0422a"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000035","language":"en","text":"The furniture in their office is in bad condition.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-5943d50531fe"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000036","language":"en","text":"My advice is to keep your mouth shut.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-b9b6ac24751d"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000037","language":"en","text":"The trouble is that he has no money left.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-e8b6e50c44f5"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000038","language":"en","text":"The milk seems off.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-86b60a2de187"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000039","language":"en","text":"I consider him my friend.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-83cbfd7af330"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000040","language":"en","text":"We found the flat in very good condition.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-f3110094ae50"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000041","language":"en","text":"I heard her sing.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-deca96d33611","en-pa-f3cb18e5f15a","en-pa-604ed4f59cb3"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000042","language":"en","text":"We found her sitting on the porch.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-7b8c9b7a6480"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000043","language":"en","text":"You may call it what you like.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-30f123af6873"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000044","language":"en","text":"The journey lasted an entire month.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-013f748f8615"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000045","language":"en","text":"The emigrant returned home to die.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-91f4326e04bc"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000046","language":"en","text":"Knowing my temper, I didn't reply.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-8f64046e9561","en-pa-b4d52a0079ee"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000047","language":"en","text":"She telephoned while you were out.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-00bf03aee491","en-pa-4617476f8fd3"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000048","language":"en","text":"I noticed that he spoke English with an Australian accent.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-e4997112bf4d"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000049","language":"en","text":"I think you have some influence on her.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-6a0d4e76a971","en-pa-76126ab530f3"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000050","language":"en","text":"I have heard that you are a car mechanic and that your brother is a plumber.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-e3e188fbaafa"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000051","language":"en","text":"What you want is impossible.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-62bf19129933"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000052","language":"en","text":"Whether he will agree is not certain.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-8eaa13cae7c8"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000053","language":"en","text":"The fact that he is now old and weak must be taken into consideration.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-147056d47ce3"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000054","language":"en","text":"I am not sure what he wants.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-cb8f411063a6"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000055","language":"en","text":"I am sorry that I couldn't meet you at the station.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-94a9d2358c41"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000056","language":"en","text":"I can't go out with you because I am studying this evening.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-bd780dadebc3"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000057","language":"en","text":"Since it is your fault, you should apologize.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-d794f3e57a67"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000058","language":"en","text":"If it weren't so cold, it would be nice.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-fd3802d350b1","en-pa-08656b5b0755"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000059","language":"en","text":"Unless she studies harder, she won't pass the exam.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-4e488e486cd3"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000060","language":"en","text":"They are working night and day so that they may open the subway at the scheduled time.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-92ff55262e6b"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000061","language":"en","text":"Wherever he went, he was welcome.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-6b9c912a75ee"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000062","language":"en","text":"He spends his money as if he were rich.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-8c29f8d5541e"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000063","language":"en","text":"She was as friendly as she had ever been.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-2c80bf1cd1a5","en-pa-baca163ebae5"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000064","language":"en","text":"Entering the room, he noticed that the windows were open.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-c26529dbc0ed"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000065","language":"en","text":"On arriving at the cottage, Tom found it burnt down.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-49c7f7228517"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000066","language":"en","text":"Although always helpful, he was not much liked.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-a2111f6173ad"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000067","language":"en","text":"Even if still working, the engine is not reliable.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-491e4ff3438e"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000068","language":"en","text":"The record I am listening to is a present from Moscow.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-9e6a00993ce1"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000069","language":"en","text":"Our granny of whom we were very fond died unexpectedly.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-5576945ec638"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000070","language":"en","text":"I could see no reason why I should refuse a drink.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-bb093d9d0505"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000071","language":"en","text":"I liked the present which Mrs. Thompson sent me.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-d50d05e5f6e5"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000072","language":"en","text":"He is no longer the man he was.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-63c3fd8430fd"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000073","language":"en","text":"Any person who wishes to see me must take an appointment.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-3c3d4cc534c1"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000074","language":"en","text":"The giant panda, which is to be found in the remote parts of China, lives exclusively on bamboo shoots.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-93748640293e"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000075","language":"en","text":"The following day which was Friday he left for Belgrade.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-22401b530f74"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
{"id":"en-s000076","language":"en","text":"Time will show whether we are right or wrong.","source":{"source_id":"ssd-english-pilot","document_id":null,"licence":"CC-BY-4.0","attribution":"Sentence Sense Detective contributors"},"pedagogical_annotations":["en-pa-7c74d8fe0fec"],"review_status":"teacher-reviewed"}
